               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_53773762">
                  <p xml:id="idm29">A handwritten copy of the text marked 2b and 3a is enclosed. It contains the last part of scenes 11 and scenes 12-14 (end of Act One). The parts which should be set to music are underlined in red crayon. The last sentence, which Hartmann has set to music, is the beginning of scene 13 "han kommer, jeg endnu engang ham seer, og vi maae skilles". Since the manuscript ends here, it is probably a fragment.</p>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
